# F00 / BLD-24: one line-ending contract for every checkout (Windows autocrlf=true included).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bash text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.jks binary
*.keystore binary
*.pdf binary
